  "bodyHash": "abf524ce4ccaf500",
  "content": "\n\n请提供需要翻译的文本。\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=请我喝杯咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成为赞助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成为赞助者\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入我们的Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=维基&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"维基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 将生物投票中落选及被遗忘的生物加入了游戏。主要目标之一是进一步扩展原始概念，并为所有生物添加新的原版风格特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你可以查看 <a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">维基</a>，以获取已实装生物和特性的详细概览。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"螃蟹\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，一种在红树林沼泽和海滩上游荡的友好生物。\n\t想要延伸你的移动范围吗？蟹钳可用于制作一种增加移动范围的药水，为你的冒险提供宝贵优势。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a> 这个小家伙，你需要海带和耐心，因为螃蟹需要将卵“埋”在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"挥动的螃蟹\" title=\"挥动的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"螃蟹攀爬红树林\" title=\"螃蟹攀爬红树林\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与螃蟹相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">蟹钳</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">延展</a> 状态效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一种具有雕塑感的生物，可以手持并展示你给予它的任何物品，但请注意，当它不睡觉时，它喜欢即兴散步。\n\t想让凝灰岩傀儡留在原地？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜂巢</a> 把它“粘”住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 这个沉睡的美人，需要收集一个凝灰岩方块、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">颜色</a> 的羊毛方块和一个南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"沉睡的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"沉睡的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"捣蛋鬼\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"捣蛋鬼\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>捣蛋鬼</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t发现 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">捣蛋鬼</a>，一种在矿洞中调皮的小生物，热衷于捉迷藏。\n\t它既顽皮又乐于助人，在你寻找时会给你提示。\n\t找到它三次，它就会奖励你梦寐以求的聚珍瓶！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"矿洞中的捣蛋鬼\" title=\"矿洞中的捣蛋鬼\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"捣蛋鬼抛出聚珍瓶\" title=\"捣蛋鬼抛出聚珍瓶\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"铜傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"铜傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>铜傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t认识一下 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">铜傀儡</a>，这是一种口袋大小的喜剧奇迹，喜欢随机按下铜按钮。\n\t像其他所有铜制品一样，它会随时间 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\">氧化</a>，但别担心，维护起来非常简单！想快速翻新？拿一把 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧头</a> 或一个 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜂巢</a> 即可。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">制造</a> 这个小家伙，需要收集一个铜块、一个南瓜和一个避雷针。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\" title=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"铜傀儡\" title=\"铜傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与铜傀儡相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">铜傀儡工作站</a> 村庄结构</li>\n\t<li>所有铜质版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">铜按钮</a></li>\n\t<li>所有铜质版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷针</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"闪光怪\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"闪光怪\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>闪光怪</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">闪光怪</a>，一种生活在繁茂洞穴中、傲娇又可爱的苔藓伙伴，它讨厌黑暗。\n\t你也讨厌黑暗吗？如果是的话，闪光怪可以为你标出足以生成怪物的昏暗区域。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">驯服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a> 这个小可爱，你需要荧光浆果，但请注意，闪光怪会定期偷吃它们，不留残渣。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼年和成年闪光怪\" title=\"幼年和成年闪光怪\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"在繁茂洞穴中飞行的闪光怪\" title=\"在繁茂洞穴中飞行的闪光怪\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"冰术师\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰术师\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遇见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰术师</a>，一位居住在深雪之中的孤独灾厄村民。\n\t你可以通过在树林中寻找一座小型冷杉 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小屋</a> 来找到他。\n\t但在冒险时要小心，多年的荒野生活使他的心比周围的寒冰更加冰冷。如果他发现你，请准备好迎接 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰霜攻击</a>，让你的冒险变成一场凛冽的挑战。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪地中的冰术师小屋\" title=\"雪地中的冰术师小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"冰术师攻击村民\" title=\"冰术师攻击村民\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与冰术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰术师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰冻图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"花牛\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"花牛\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>花牛</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t\tPresenting the <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">花牛</a>，一种沐浴阳光、身披美丽花朵的奶牛，主要生活在繁花森林中。\n\t\t这些披着花朵的伙伴不仅赏心悦目，还能与蜜蜂产生和谐的协同效应。\n\t\t它们在穿行时会留下一串盛开的花丛足迹，让每一步都成为探索自然奇观的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"毛茛花牛\" title=\"毛茛花牛\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花花牛\" title=\"繁花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与花牛相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">毛茛</a> 花朵</li>\n\t<li>所有木质版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">养蜂人专区</a> 村庄结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">养蜂人</a> 村民职业</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"野火\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>野火</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，由四面盾牌守护。\n\t这次遭遇战并不友好，注意躲避它的盾牌碎片弹幕和震地冲击波攻击。\n\t被逼入绝境时，它会召唤烈焰人作为援军。征服挑战，在你的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a> 领地中运用策略对抗这位火焰哨兵。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"下界中的堡垒结构\" title=\"下界中的堡垒结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"堡垒中的野火\" title=\"堡垒中的野火\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与野火相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"掠食者（大饥荒）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"掠食者\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>掠食者（大饥荒）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\">掠食者</a>，一种在草原、恶地和沙漠中游荡的小型掠食动物。它们正在搜寻鸡、兔子等猎物。\n\t你可以喂食它们附魔物品来 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\">储存经验值</a>，之后再用瓶子提取。但请注意，储存的经验值越多，掠食者就会变得越大、越饥饿！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"狩猎鸡群的掠食者\" title=\"狩猎鸡群的掠食者\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\"  alt=\"喂养后的掠食者\" title=\"喂养后的掠食者\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"幻术师\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻术师\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幻术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遇见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\">幻术师</a>，一位手持弓箭、狡诈多变的灾厄村民，居住在针叶林中。你可以通过搜索一座小木屋或其训练场来找到他。\n\t请谨慎靠近，因为 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\">致盲咒语</a> 可能让你陷入黑暗，难以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\">幻影</a> 与现实。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"针叶林中的幻术师小屋\" title=\"针叶林中的幻术师小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"训练场中的幻术师\" title=\"训练场中的幻术师\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与幻术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\">幻术师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\">幻象图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"僵尸马（陷阱）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"僵尸马（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>僵尸马（陷阱）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t是否曾想过骑乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\">僵尸马</a>？如果是，请在雷暴期间靠近它，魔法或许会发生——你甚至可能一睹“天启四骑士”的真容。”\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的僵尸马\" title=\"雷暴中的僵尸马\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的四骑士\" title=\"雷暴中的四骑士\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 兼容性 / 附加组件</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 旨在与其他所有模组完全兼容，目前提供以下附加组件和数据包：\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花花牛</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\">Friends&amp;Foes - 养蜂人小屋</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">结构重制 - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社区</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器社区</a> 进行聊天、分享作品、提问，或仅为了了解模组的最新开发动态并在新版本发布时收到通知。\n\t也请随时通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\">GitHub Issues 报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支持</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t我会继续将模组开发作为爱好，因为我真心热爱它。如果你想支持我，可以通过 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 进行赞助。非常感谢你的支持！\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 许可证</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t本模组采用 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 许可证授权。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎浏览我的代码，了解我在开发此模组时如何解决各种挑战的示例。你可以自由地将代码片段融入你自己的项目中。也欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组（尽管如果能注明出处/链接回此页面将不胜感激）。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\">blockbench 目录</a>（包含所有模型与调色板）以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\">textures 目录</a> 中的纹理素材。欢迎从中获取灵感，但请勿直接复制粘贴并声称是自己的作品。\n</p>",
